== Description ==

'''Forged Iron''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 52 downstream recipes at 6 different workbenches, including [[Wrought Iron]], [[M1891 01]], [[R870 01]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[M1911]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

